<title>UK: Barclays says revises balance sheet figures.</title>
<headline>Barclays says revises balance sheet figures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British banking group  Barclays Plc said on Tuesday that certain balance sheet figures in its 1996 preliminary results had been revised in the annual report published on today but the changes would have no impact on the profit and loss account.</p>
<p>In the figures published in February 1.004 billion stg of international non-sterling liabilities were mis-classified as domestic.</p>
</text>
